Vendored tskit C API for RcppLDGM
=================================

Source: https://github.com/tskit-dev/tskit, C API release tag C_1.3.1
(commit 143cd7845774e323fa7992f9f7e6d8ef9cc5bbda).

Copied files:
- c/tskit.h -> src/tskit.h
- c/tskit/*.c and c/tskit/*.h -> src/tskit/
- c/subprojects/kastore/kastore.[ch] -> src/tskit/subprojects/kastore/
- VERSION.txt files for tskit and kastore.

Local R-package patch:
- src/tskit/core.h redirects tsk_bug_assert() to Rf_error(), tsk trace errors
  to Rf_warning() when tracing is enabled, and the default debug stream to the
  platform null device. This avoids abort/stdout/stderr symbols in R CMD check.
- No LDGM or tskit algorithm semantics are changed by this patch.

Update procedure:
1. Replace the copied files from a released C_* tskit tag, not from main.
2. Re-apply the R-package core.h patch above.
3. Re-run Rcpp::compileAttributes("."), tinytest, upstream LDGM conformance,
   benchmark smoke, R CMD build, and R CMD check --no-manual.
